OL,3,GNEWSAResort's pleasure pier shuts for
OL,4,Aessential repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seaside resort's pleasure pier has
OL,7,Fbeen temporarily closed while repairs
OL,8,Fare carried out.
OL,10,FDorset Council said the structure in
OL,11,FWeymouth needed to undergo surfacing
OL,12,Fworks along its wall, while steps down
OL,13,Fto the beach are refurbished and new
OL,14,Fhandrails finished off.
OL,16,FThe council said: "Thank you for your
OL,17,Funderstanding and cooperation while
OL,18,Fthese essential improvement works are
OL,19,Fcarried out."
