OL,3,GNEWSAResort's pleasure pier shuts for
OL,4,Aessential repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pier would remain shut for two
OL,7,Fweeks from Monday. The beach access
OL,8,Fsteps are due to reopen before the
OL,9,Ftown's annual triathlon event, Ironman
OL,10,F70.3, on Sunday 20 September.
